{"n":101,"verses":[{"k":1,"w":[["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","al-qaari'at"]],"en":"The Striking Calamity -","t":{"6":[[400,2940]],"12":[[300,2320]],"7":[[150,1700]],"9":[[250,2150]]}},{"k":2,"w":[["مَا","maa"],["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","l-qaari'at"]],"en":"What is the Striking Calamity?","t":{"6":[[480,720],[730,3050]],"12":[[450,610],[620,2610]],"7":[[40,240],[250,1640]],"9":[[300,520],[530,2240]]}},{"k":3,"w":[["وَمَآ","wamaa"],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","adraaka"],["مَا","maa"],["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","l-qaari'at"]],"en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","t":{"6":[[420,2430],[2440,4360],[4370,4720],[4730,6880]],"12":[[400,2330],[2340,3880],[3890,4130],[4140,5960]],"7":[[40,330],[340,3590],[3600,3730],[3740,4910]],"9":[[430,2580],[2590,3970],[3980,4200],[4210,5860]]}},{"k":4,"w":[["يَوْمَ","yawma"],["يَكُونُ","yakoonu"],["ٱلنَّاسُ","l-naasu"],["كَٱلْفَرَاشِ","kal-faraashi"],["ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","l-mabthooth"]],"en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","t":{"6":[[550,1410],[1420,3170],[3180,4790],[4800,7060],[7070,9750]],"12":[[500,1250],[1260,2590],[2600,4020],[4030,5960],[5970,7930]],"7":[[90,610],[620,1530],[1540,3040],[3050,4410],[4420,7300]],"9":[[300,1050],[1060,2250],[2260,3970],[3980,5840],[5850,7510]]}},{"k":5,"w":[["وَتَكُونُ","watakoonu"],["ٱلْجِبَالُ","l-jibaalu"],["كَٱلْعِهْنِ","kal-'ih'ni"],["ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","l-manfoosh"]],"en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","t":{"6":[[150,1880],[1890,3590],[3600,5610],[5620,8910]],"12":[[250,1660],[1670,3110],[3120,4700],[4710,7250]],"7":[[80,1100],[1110,2190],[2200,3330],[3340,7210]],"9":[[400,1880],[1890,3200],[3210,4670],[4680,7130]]}},{"k":6,"w":[["فَأَمَّا","fa-ammaa"],["مَن","man"],["ثَقُلَتْ","thaqulat"],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","mawaazeenuh"]],"en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","t":{"6":[[350,2500],[2510,3720],[3730,5290],[5300,7650]],"12":[[400,770],[780,3030],[3040,4340],[4350,6370]],"7":[[50,1960],[1970,2950],[2960,3820],[3830,5230]],"9":[[350,2070],[2080,2990],[3000,4